old #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/day_strip_above_badges_root_parents.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-c5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-c5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire rollup frontmatter in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire-rollup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire-rollup: delete rollup parsing, selection, lints, catalog counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the projects-list marker from bob-cli; rename the pre-rollup chain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the residence chain; update vectors, H-vectors, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The root_parent dimension in bob stats[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-dimension[dim] · [dim][/dim]after retire-rollup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-dimension: derive each home's root parent in the resolver and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report an additive root_parent parts dimension and catalog field for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro and task metrics, with human output, tests, docs, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]performance check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip above the badges with a full-width root-parent bar[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-above[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-above: host the strip as the bob-plan block's first child, add the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-width bar row under a legend and meta row, prefer root_parent parts[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with an area fallback, and extend the preview harness and tests.[/#D7